Z||000008||Cheever3000||09-05-2001||12:04 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jenny_outlaw:<BR><B>...I am in love with my fiero.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Why is it the perfect women are always <I>taken</I>?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>There will be a lot of Fieros in a Pontiac show the 16th on the northeast side of San Antone.  Here's the info I have:<P>When: Sunday, September 16, 9AM To 4PM <BR>Where: Rolling Oaks Mall <BR>Comments: Rolling Oaks Mall is located on the NE side of town at the intersection of Loop 1604 and Nacodoches Road. <BR>Registration is from 900 am to 1130 am with awards scheduled at 400 pm <BR>Entry fee is 20 bucks as long as it is recieved by the 9th of September and 25 bucks after that date <BR>Mail entries to: <BR>SCTC Pontiac/Oakland Club <BR>C/O Jay Lord <BR>30860 Setting Sun <BR>Bulverde TX 78163 <BR>You can also call Jay for more information at 830-438-2878 <BR>Make checks payable to SCTC Pontiac/Oakland Club <P>The Great Blue Chop Top will be there.  You <B>don't</B> want to miss an opportunity to see (and hear) that car!<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever3000 (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||1
